{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302100/extras/63b9e5cd14f94b536c5a60846fdfdf5a.avif?t=1761745964\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302100/extras_big/63b9e5cd14f94b536c5a60846fdfdf5a.avif?t=1761745964 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore life after the endings \u2014 new moments, new perspectives, and new secrets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into  nine new storylines that continue the journeys of your favorite characters, each filled with new choices, revelations, and secrets waiting to be uncovered.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 unique extra endings</strong> featuring the main love interests \u2014 plus one surprising twist!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10+ hours</strong> of new story content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1,390 CGs</strong> and <strong>43 brand-new animations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fresh storylines, returning characters, and emotional resolutions</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Leah</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302100/extras/35e1f36f455db35de5d59493eab49c6b.avif?t=1761745964\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That fiery sense of justice and truth still burns strong. Life with Leah is intense \u2014 and familiar enemies return to test your bond. The fight isn\u2019t over yet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Valerie (Evil)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302100/extras/608743c9d3ba39c1c12fcb5eba2b1004.avif?t=1761745964\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you chose power over love, this one\u2019s for you. With Valerie by your side and the Fraternity under your control, new threats force you to protect your empire \u2014 even if it means rewriting the rules of Shale Hill itself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Valerie (Good)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302100/extras/171dccb9a8d9118f32fc4fc2f8f5f70b.avif?t=1761745964\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valerie\u2019s path splits in two \u2014 and this is her redemption arc. Once behind bars, she\u2019s ready to rebuild her life... but the scars left behind by the past might be harder to heal than expected.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Haley</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302100/extras/b317ac6a2937feb379d14116bba09651.avif?t=1761745964\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haley\u2019s career is on the rise, but fame comes at a cost. The music industry can be cruel, but maybe a heartfelt reunion and a dose of nostalgia will bring harmony back to her life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Emily</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302100/extras/fdcdedbb81e50a1b29ec27cd46353617.avif?t=1761745964\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new company led by the MC and his friends promises to shake things up in Shale Hill. Old challenges resurface, but teamwork and love might finally bring that long-awaited happy ending.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sam</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302100/extras/cf879b2482b4d16845bede2a4fc6b237.avif?t=1761745964\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this alternate path, you\u2019ve won the election and ended your student council presidency with flying colors. Adult life beckons, far from politics \u2014 or so you think. When fate calls again, will you resist, or embrace your destiny?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Maggie</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302100/extras/c5fd678c5c4d1ac8718690e011ffa342.avif?t=1761745964\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As always, Maggie\u2019s family drama takes center stage. With her new career taking off, she\u2019ll have to balance ambition and family ties while uncovering new secrets about her past.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lidia</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302100/extras/051518dbf0aa93b13cf2d4e899c49566.avif?t=1761745964\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and Lidia now manage the campus caf\u00e9 \u2014 a quiet, comfortable life... But peace is short-lived. A ghost from the past threatens your new routine, and your experience in Shale Hill might be the key to surviving what\u2019s next.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dante</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302100/extras/bff2fa1072bbce3ddb7ecaa46bf582a0.avif?t=1761745964\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And finally\u2026 the world\u2019s straightest man returns!<br>Even without choosing a romance, your story is far from over. Join Dante for a wild, unexpected adventure \u2014 and maybe, just maybe, a \u201chappy ending\u201d of your own.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nine new endings. Endless possibilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Epilogues: Extended Endings</i> is the definitive continuation of <i>Shale Hill Secrets</i> \u2014 made for players who wanted to see what happens after the credits roll.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3302100?t=1761745964","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302100/8f2217ce46c0ae38738e256f5f1997d2f4ff026a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761745964","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302100/9b29760662c224daf05948a247e18cf28d0c5712/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761745964","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302100/9b29760662c224daf05948a247e18cf28d0c5712/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761745964","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"This game contains explicit sexual content including depictions of full nudity (male and female), visible genitals, and detailed sexual acts. Sexual activity is shown with explicit visual detail, sound effects, and animations.\r\n\r\nSexual scenes may portray:\r\n- Vaginal and anal intercourse (multiple positions)\r\n- Oral sex (giving and receiving)\r\n- Masturbation\r\n- Kissing, caressing, and foreplay\r\n\r\nOther mature topics include:\r\n- Mild non-sexual violence, such as fistfights and verbal arguments