ttps://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302100/extras/bff2fa1072bbce3ddb7ecaa46bf582a0.avif?t=1761745964\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And finally\u2026 the world\u2019s straightest man returns!<br>Even without choosing a romance, your story is far from over. Join Dante for a wild, unexpected adventure \u2014 and maybe, just maybe, a \u201chappy ending\u201d of your own.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nine new endings. Endless possibilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Epilogues: Extended Endings</i> is the definitive continuation of <i>Shale Hill Secrets</i> \u2014 made for players who wanted to see what happens after the credits roll.</p>","developers":["Love-Joint"],"fullgame":{"appid":"1793440","name":"Shale Hill Secrets"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302100/c5e2b81ebe6af9dd441cd82a932fa7893d07c3b0/header.jpg?t=1761745964","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Monterey<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4400<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Sequoia<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1 or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3302100/1311108622/a7546dddbbea73ea47a7e82935559da64f8891ab/1760641920/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761655100","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto